## Step-by-Step Setup Instructions

### ✅ 1. Install pfSense on Hyper-V

1. Download pfSense ISO: https://www.pfsense.org/download/
2. Create a Generation 2 VM in Hyper-V
3. Add two (2) network adapters:
   - WAN: Connected to external switch
   - LAN: Connected to internal switch
4. Assign 2 vCPUs, 2GB RAM, and 20GB HDD
5. Boot from ISO and install

### ✅ 2. Set IPs for Interfaces

- WAN IP: 192.168.2.42/24 (DHCP or static)
- LAN IP: 192.168.1.1/24 (static)

